## Performance Characteristics

### Throughput
- **Target RPS**: 10,000 requests per second
- **Concurrent Connections**: Up to 1,000 simultaneous connections
- **Message Size**: Optimal for messages < 1MB

### Latency
- **P50**: < 10ms
- **P95**: < 50ms
- **P99**: < 100ms

### Streaming
- **Client Streaming**: Up to 1,000 messages per stream
- **Server Streaming**: Unlimited response messages
- **Bidirectional**: Real-time processing support

